        "To optimize per-meal dosing, aim for 0.40 to 0.55 grams of high-quality protein per kilogram of bodyweight per meal across three to four feedings. For an 80kg individual, this translates to distinct meals containing approximately 32 to 44 grams of protein each, ensuring that every feeding comfortably surpasses the necessary leucine trigger. Utilizing a specialized high protein intake for muscle gain calculator makes it effortless to personalize these exact per-meal gram targets based on your lean body mass, age, and weekly resistance training volume.",
